<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90778" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προ-χρημᾰτίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>transact business before</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλο δὲ π. τούτων μηδέν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.57.55
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to be formerly styled</i> so-and-so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ισάσης ἀπὸ κώμης Τεπτύνεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					333.3
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				614.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of a name, <i>to be mentioned at the beginning</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προχρηματίζειν τὸ τοῦ Διὸς Παναμάρου
					ὄνομα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
					4.263.17
				</span></i>
			 (Panamara, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
